      "id": "claim_a92a213a430c4e9e8cac73490f5ecdb8",
      "statement": "dispatch_agent_run enforces a strict validation contract: if a prebuilt input is provided with any of raw fields (content, context, channels, systems), it raises ValueError. Otherwise it normalizes Slack, Linear, and GitHub events into ordered RunInput transcripts with attributed identities and structured metadata, then creates a durable Protocol-v3 run with async durability, resumable event streams, and optional webhook.",
